web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "a2117df217dc3620b6f1a5d2d150a20e40aa7c7c", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/commits/a2117df217dc3620b6f1a5d2d150a20e40aa7c7c", "html_url": "https://github.com/moveit/moveit2/commit/a2117df217dc3620b6f1a5d2d150a20e40aa7c7c"}]}, {"sha": "a2117df217dc3620b6f1a5d2d150a20e40aa7c7c", "node_id": "C_kwDOCi-gUdoAKGEyMTE3ZGYyMTdkYzM2MjBiNmYxYTVkMmQxNTBhMjBlNDBhYTdjN2M", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Dundy Pasupuleti", "email": "42792754+dundysm@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2026-09-28T16:17:13Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-09-28T16:17:13Z"}, "message": "fix: synchronize TrajectoryExecutionManager::execution_complete_ (#3853)\n\nFixes #3852.\n\nMake execution_complete_ a std::atomic<bool> so concurrent unlocked\nreads in executeThread()/executePart() are synchronized with writes\nfrom stopExecution() (and the worker completion path) without changing\nthe existing mutex + condition_variable join/wait protocol.\n\nPrefer atomic over forcing every hot-path poll under\nexecution_state_mutex_, matching nearby planning code that uses\nstd::atomic<bool> for cross-thread stop/preemption flags.\n\nSigned-off-by: Dundy Pasupuleti <dundysm@gmail.com>", "tree": {"sha": "8e85f0901f9d76ac5cae4d39ecd32b4866ca3289", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/git/trees/8e85f0901f9d76ac5cae4d39ecd32b4866ca3289"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/git/commits/a2117df217dc3620b6f1a5d2d150a20e40aa7c7c", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqupMJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXDYQAHUTRYWdfGOhHlFjhcFsCfBk\