---END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree cb40fbbf0ef01c174e914ac258c3ef2c51397e9b\nparent 3f0d3f230bd5ab10156b904dfa48fc61b6e10b86\nauthor Robert Haschke <rhaschke@users.noreply.github.com> 1790584324 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790584324 +0200\n\nrviz joints tab: show goal state model onFinishedExecution() (#3886)\n\nAfter Plan+Execute, the joints tab switched back to the start state model because onFinishedExecution()\nupdates this state to the current one usually. Hence, it was the last model modified...\nEnsure that the goal state gets updated in any case.", "verified_at": "2026-09-28T08:32:04Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/commits/277a3340839f0297c2dd1365be84e350d49acac9", "html_url": "https://github.com/moveit/moveit2/commit/277a3340839f0297c2dd1365be84e350d49acac9", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/commits/277a3340839f0297c2dd1365be84e350d49acac9/comments", "author": {"login": "rhaschke", "id": 5376030, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzYwMzA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5376030?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke", "html_url": "https://github.com/rhaschke", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/rhaschke/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "3f0d3f230bd5ab10156b904dfa48fc61b6e10b86", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/commits/3f0d3f230bd5ab10156b904dfa48fc61b6e10b86", "html_url": "https://github.com/moveit/moveit2/commit/3f0d3f230bd5ab10156b904dfa48fc61b6e10b86"}]}, {"sha": "3f0d3f230bd5ab10156b904dfa48fc61b6e10b86", "node_id": "C_kwDOCi-gUdoAKDNmMGQzZjIzMGJkNWFiMTAxNTZiOTA0ZGZhNDhmYzYxYjZlMTBiODY", "commit": {"author": {"name": "hugogo1998", "email": "295481948+hugogo1998@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2026-09-28T08:31:36Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2026-09-28T08:31:36Z"}, "message": "Solve the IK velocity step via JJ^T eigendecomposition, not JacobiSVD (#3804)\n\nChainIkSolverVelMimicSVD::CartToJnt runs once per Newton iteration of the IK solver, and each call spent ~94% of the time computing JacobiSVD of the 6xN Jacobian (rows <= 6, cols = number of active joints).\n\nUsing the eigendecomposition of the small rows x rows matrix JJ^T instead yields a performance boost by a factor of 2-3.", "tree": {"sha": "c86794eaa7441ace581f99cdc451a584785b958d", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/git/trees/c86794eaa7441ace581f99cdc451a584785b958d"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/git/commits/3f0d3f230bd5ab10156b904dfa48fc61b6e10b86", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquiXoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAISoQAIfYRRGbIDaE9TtnSxzd1ALP\nqgGqmJDVjSPkontvXhYzAPwqk4ys1Nwqt/CikGVtDCkGIdckv22jICvZL7yK/naX\n9nAteP8lx42LBSTkJfoeH9GTA3OyE74ol3rDLwWfrtEvvmCcuzFF25pRVXIfD5Q/\nfwfY+jcbb5I2h97t7+6S4rOA2opEBBEcOc283bQVP7uw1gRbTs97PfAL0AWG//c1\nh+ashfdhPPAEU5Gaowbyo8FTLffWZD/CBfPkFaNwGHiBgAjFcpxqPwgMIw1TD5WM\nlGX935sZAKXxNQ1njjPk60404y50wOuZbN/oPFnydw2QgUoHaCwm7mRDuxubr1x6\nV1RvEeRdZaFLB/97RkV8IetyvqpUkA5LmSCdX/Ab3iEPP0urL4Ro1agmbvqr/lqp\n1sJW1R1jk7hYutBlmlQ0jhiSBRNrGcQGBffZSTA0UsVDvvK9nMasCRIevyWCgsim\nxWtc5BObVw1npi+GtvuK6GQt6SDwTJQ5z4hyCgd56p35aKgB0OqiM24rrDfbnStb\nlbzm0nARbcE8OgLbd0ciK+SfDKCQU7zA9/A2bAFl2EZSuM+hVgo9qlxLR+Qqe7b7\nOOedOgRX3oIJCHTAr0BZGTQ33zGw1R7T229/WgGuk/QRkOCSujUsTw791jRmH2Y/\nabaXnSvrXczse97+kar4\n=zxcC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree c86794eaa7441ace581f99cdc451a584785b958d\nparent dcf951509c3a1a4c59d7c683bb08afe9109a0ffc\nauthor hugogo1998 <295481948+hugogo1998@users.noreply.github.com> 1790584296 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790584296 +0200\n\nSolve the IK velocity step via JJ^T eigendecomposition, not JacobiSVD (#3804)\n\nChainIkSolverVelMimicSVD::CartToJnt runs once per Newton iteration of the IK solver, and each call spent ~94% of the time computing JacobiSVD of the 6xN Jacobian (rows <= 6, cols = number of active joints).\n\nUsing the eigendecomposition of the small rows x rows matrix JJ^T instead yields a performance boost by a factor of 2-3.", "verified_at": "2026-09-28T08:31:36Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/moveit/moveit2/commits/3f0d3f230bd5ab10156b904dfa48fc61b6e10b86", "html_url": "https://github.com